{"reviews":[{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-0","r":1.0,"t":"Not what I expected","x":"I mean, for the price, I couldn't really ask for much. But they aren't as helpful as I thought they would be. The stamps are basically checkmarks. When I tried them on the wing for the eyeliner was so angled it really did look like a check. The material is plastic, so the liquid eyeliner didn't stay well on it and whenI stamped it on, it smudged really badly. I thought maybe I just didn't know how to use it, so I continued practicing. In the end, you have to use way too much eyeliner to get it e","h":29,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-1","r":1.0,"t":"Negligent seller","x":"Received this product and it was clearly USED. Quite upsetting and disgusting - especially considering the global circumstances where hygiene is key. Negligent in behalf of the seller and on behalf of the person who used them and then returned it without cleaning... dreadful","h":19,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-2","r":5.0,"t":"LOVED","x":"I LOVED THESE EASY TO USE. GREAT INVENTION. GREAT PRODUCT","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-3","r":5.0,"t":"Great makeup tool!","x":"I love these stampers! Super simple to use. It took me about 5 minutes to put winged eyeliner on BOTH of my eyes! It usually takes me at least 15 minutes to do one eye because I can never make them even. Just love these stampers! And I don\u2019t have to worry about running out of the eyeliner and buying more like you have to do with other stampers. I can use these for as long as I feel like doing winged eyeliner. \ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a\ud83d\ude0a","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-4","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth it","x":"Believe the negative reviews you reads. My liquid eyeliner dried so fast I didn\u2019t have time to apply it on my eye. I tried with a pencil eyeliner to see if at least I could get the shape, but looks like I\u2019ll be doomed with uneven eyeliner forever.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-5","r":4.0,"t":"Good!!","x":"It seems like a pretty good product. I have tried it a few times and I am having a hard time getting this technique down, but that is on me not the product.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-6","r":5.0,"t":"Saving grace","x":"I can finally have the winged eyeliner.  Thank you so much for this product","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-7","r":5.0,"t":"You just have to know how to use them","x":"This works really well, its important to not push too hard or load it up with too much product, I recommend only placing product on the wing portion of the stamp","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-8","r":1.0,"t":"not happy","x":"hard to use as it is very long so you have to close your eye or itll jab you so its hard to make it straight. also the eyeliner doesnt go on very well. id go for something different. i have other stamps and this ones the worst","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-9","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t work","x":"Didn\u2019t get as far as smudge proof because they don\u2019t hold the eyeliner liquid enough to transfer to your eyelid. Not even enough to set a pattern you can then fill in free hand.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-10","r":1.0,"t":"Ehhh","x":"I thought this would help me perfect my wing eyeliner but I was wrong. It's complicated to use and doesn't work well at all! I'm better off free handing it like I was.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-11","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth buying","x":"Definitely not easy to use if you were to ask me and the eyeliner doesn\u2019t transfer to your skin very well from the stamp.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-12","r":1.0,"t":"Don't buy it","x":"I got this it dont work as it says it does. Don't buy it you are wasting money \ud83d\ude12","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-13","r":4.0,"t":"It's an alright product","x":"It's a great idea but it will take some practice to get it down just right","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-14","r":1.0,"t":"Not impressed.","x":"Flimsy and doesn\u2019t stamp entirely.  Very blotchy.  Don\u2019t recommend these.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-15","r":1.0,"t":"Not impressed","x":"My eyeliner would look better if my 3 year old granddaughter did it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-16","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn't work","x":"Liquid liner stuck to the tool but none on my lid. Pointless.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-17","r":1.0,"t":"Nope!!!","x":"They don\u2019t work at all. Definitely a waste of money","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-18","r":1.0,"t":"Crap. Not worth your money.","x":"The plastic material they use causes any eyeliner to disperse & won't stay on the surface. When you attempt to apply it, barely any makes it on your skin & it's splotchy & uneven. I don't know if they even tested the material before trying to sell these things, but your eyeliner won't stick to it long enough to be applied. I returned it the very next day.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-19","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible","x":"This product was a complete waste of money. They are very hard to lineup, the marks that they make is patchy and sometimes doesn\u2019t even show up and when they did show up the way they were shaped was completely and totally wrong. I would never recommend this to anybody else and I really wish I could get my money back","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-20","r":1.0,"t":"Doesn\u2019t work","x":"Doesn\u2019t work! Arrived in a tiny plastic bag with no instructions and no information at first I thought it was garbage I was about to throw it out. When I realized what it was I was disappointed when I saw her and then when I tried it it definitely doesn\u2019t work. Return the item not worth the hassle of trying","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-21","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome","x":"I love these! Very helpful and they also teach you how to make a cat eye without using them. After using them and seeing what it\u2019s supposed to look like, I can now duplicate the look without the stamp. I recommend these","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-22","r":2.0,"t":"Hard to use, only for liquid eye liner.","x":"These only work with liquid eyeliner. I can't get any other eye liner to work. It doesn't give me a sharp cat eye. It's easy to mess up and do at an odd angle. I guess it's ok for the price but it's a struggle to use.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2020"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not what I was expecting","x":"I didn't have a great experience trying to use this product. It just didn't work easily like the ad was saying the product was suppose to. I was disappointed to the point where I wound up throwing away this purchase.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B07QJVZPJ1-24","r":1.0,"t":"No good","x":"Doesn't work at all like it claims, I was really excited to get this product but it doesn't work, I have tried liquid eyeliner pencil eyeliner and even eyeshadow, it applies none of them. Will not be buying again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers find the stamper difficult or complicated to use, especially for getting a straight, even wing.","cites":[1,6,9,11,12,14]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the eyeliner liquid does not transfer well from the stamp to the eyelid, leaving blotchy or incomplete results.","cites":[1,5,10,12,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say the product simply doesn't work as advertised and isn't worth buying.","cites":[5,10,11,13,15]},{"text":"Many positive reviewers love the product, finding it easy to use and a fast way to achieve winged eyeliner.","cites":[3,4,7,8]},{"text":"Some reviewers note it takes practice and technique to get right, but consider it a good idea or product.","cites":[6,8,14]}]},"qa":[]}